      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054007500200065007300200010000201000000002C0020006320190065007300740020006200690065006E002000E700610020003F000A004A0065002000742019006100690020006100700065007200E7007500100003110000FF0100006500200061007500200052006F00790061006C00650020005A002D0041002E001000020114018D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En tant que Dresseur, je suis un grand fan\nde ce tournoi.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƍ",
