      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006E002000740061006E00740020007100750065002000440072006500730073006500750072002C0020006A00650020007300750069007300200075006E0020006700720061006E0064002000660061006E000A0064006500200063006500200074006F00750072006E006F0069002E001000020114018D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Chaque fois que j’imagine une nouvelle tactique,\nj’aime la tester dans le cadre du Royale Z-A.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Du coup, je dois avouer que tu m’intrigues... Mais\nje ne m’attendais pas à ce que tu sois si jeune !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 105
    },
    {
      "displayText": "On dirait bien que le niveau du Royale Z-A\nn’est plus ce qu’il était...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bah, pour en avoir le cœur net, rien de tel qu’un\ncombat Pokémon ! Admire mes tactiques !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Viens me parler quand tu auras fini\ntes préparations au combat !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005600690065006E00730020006D00650020007000610072006C006500720020007100750061006E0064002000740075002000610075007200610073002000660069006E0069000A00740065007300200070007200E9007000610072006100740069006F006E007300200061007500200063006F006D00620061007400200021001000020114018D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Veux-tu essayer de déjouer mes tactiques ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0056006500750078002D00740075002000650073007300610079006500720020006400650020006400E9006A006F0075006500720020006D0065007300200074006100630074006900710075006500730020003F001000020114018D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pourquoi pas ?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006F0075007200710075006F006900200070006100730020003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sans façon.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00530061006E007300200066006100E7006F006E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Un<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿଉ Dresseure Dresseuse, jeune espoir du Royale Z-A,\nqui refuse un combat ? Je n’y crois pas !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 103
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En combat, infliger des dégâts est crucial, mais\nil ne faut pas négliger le reste.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je vais te montrer ce dont un Pokémon est\ncapable lorsqu’il tient une Baie !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1828,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Miséricorde ! Comment as-tu pu venir à bout\nde ma stratégie ? Je n’en reviens pas...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nTu savais donc que les objets tenus ont des effets\nadaptés à tous types de situations ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1992,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 180
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En l’honneur du nouveau lien qui nous unit,\nj’aimerais t’offrir des Baies Oran !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
